  "helpIntro": "Using AccessTransit",
  "helpSearchTitle": "Searching for a bus",
  "helpSearchBody": "Choose your boarding stop, destination and boarding time within the next 24 hours. Search starts with your saved accessibility preferences. Changes made for a search apply only to that search; save account-wide defaults in Settings.",
  "helpSaveTitle": "What does Save Trip do?",
  "helpSaveBody": "Open a result to see Bus Details and the selected stop segment. Saving is optional. It bookmarks the selection so you can reopen its details from saved trips; it does not book a seat or start a journey. Check refreshed times and cancellation notices when reopening.",
  "helpLocationTitle": "Using My Location",
  "helpLocationBody": "Allow location access when requested to find nearby boarding stops. Check the selected stop and direction before searching. Nearby does not establish a step-free walking route. If location is unavailable or permission is denied, choose a stop manually.",
  "helpLiveTitle": "Timetable and live location",
  "helpLiveBody": "A timetable is a plan, not proof that a bus has started. Future or unstarted runs show timetable information. Live position requires a started matching run and fresh GPS. If location is stale or unavailable, check the last-update wording. Estimates and arrival times can change.",
  "helpReportsTitle": "Reports and pending uploads",
  "helpReportsBody": "Report the exact bus or stop and what you observed. A local draft is private and is not a published report. Open Your uploads under My Reports to retry or remove it. Drafts expire after 7 days and are removed on sign-out. Avoid private information in public notes and photos.",
  "helpVotesTitle": "Voting and community disputes",
  "helpVotesBody": "Authors cannot vote True or False on their own reports. Vote only from your observations and give a reason for False. Under policy v2, five eligible other users' False votes hide a report and apply its recorded points penalty and strike. This is a community dispute, not proof of a false report. Authors can use the report review and appeal screens.",
  "helpAssistanceTitle": "Boarding assistance",
  "helpAssistanceBody": "Assistance is optional in Bus Details. Check the bus, run and boarding stop. Submitted means the request was recorded; accepted means the assigned driver accepted it. A saved trip or a sent request does not guarantee assistance. Check the latest request status, including decline, cancellation or expiry.",
  "helpAccessTitle": "Account access and review",
  "helpAccessBody": "If access is restricted, read the displayed reason and expiry and use the available appeal action. An appeal does not automatically lift a restriction. Permanent bans require administrator review. Self-service account deletion is not available in Profile; reviewed administrator deletion is a separate process.",
